Package: meshcentral-desktop
Version: 2.27.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, python3-websocket, python3-cairo,
 gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-vte-2.91, gir1.2-secret-1, gir1.2-webkit2-4.1
Recommends: xdg-utils, gnome-keyring, python3-qrcode
Maintainer: Denis Maggipinto (CYVELION LTD) <d.maggipinto@cyvelion.co.uk>
Homepage: https://github.com/d-maggipinto/meshcentral-desktop
Description: Unofficial native desktop client for MeshCentral
 A native GTK application for managing devices on a MeshCentral server:
 device tree, remote desktop, terminal, file manager, processes, services,
 agent console, server storage, server statistics, users, user groups and
 account settings. It signs in with a username, password and optional
 two-factor code and talks to the server over the documented control channel.
 .
 The same application is also available for Windows.
 .
 This is an independent project by CYVELION LTD. It is not affiliated with or
 endorsed by the MeshCentral project.
